      "summary": "Evidence summary: 7 validated structured observations; consult observations and conflicts for supported findings.",
      "observations": [
        {
          "category": "mechanics",
          "statement": "Players consistently describe Dead Space 3 as a stronger action-horror hybrid than its predecessors: shooting and spectacle remain enjoyable for many, but the greater combat density reduces the survival-horror tension for others.",
          "sentiment": "mixed",
          "recurrence": "moderate",
          "mention_count": 4,
