            "feedback-001",
            "feedback-002",
            "feedback-003",
            "feedback-005"
          ]
        },
        {
          "category": "coop",
          "statement": "Co-op is repeatedly praised as an enjoyable way to play and can add distinctive shared or asymmetric moments, yet some players feel the campaign is much less appealing solo and that co-op further changes the series' horror character.",
          "sentiment": "mixed",
          "recurrence": "moderate",
          "mention_count": 3,
          "evidence_languages": [
