            "feedback-005"
          ]
        },
        {
          "category": "structure",
          "statement": "World and lore elements, Tau Volantis locations, and visual atmosphere remain meaningful strengths for some players, but character drama and parts of the dialogue or relationship writing receive recurring criticism.",
